---
title: "C4 Dynamic — Choose once for a conversation"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant H as Agent harness
  participant E as Local decision engine
  participant S as Evidence cache
  participant P as Selected model provider
  Note over U,P: OpenCode / Hermes target use case, Hermes integration unverified
  U->>H: Submits opening prompt
  H->>E: Requests one pick (opening prompt, allowed list, constraints)
  E->>S: Reads candidate features and freshness
  E->>E: Filter eligible candidates, score, calibrate, rank
  E-->>H: Pick, confidence and runners-up
  H->>H: Sets model before first provider request
  H->>P: Sends opening prompt to selected model
  P-->>H: Returns response
  H-->>U: Shows response
  loop Rest of this conversation
    U->>H: Sends next message
    H->>P: Continues with the same selected model
    P-->>H: Returns response
    H-->>U: Shows response
  end
  Note over H,E: No reselection on later turns, tool calls or compaction
  Note over U,P: Assumption to test: opening prompt is sufficient for the full conversation
  Note over H,E: Selection failure uses configured fallback, details remain open
